# Deny by default. The build context is the three paths the release build of
# `iaam-bootstrap` actually reads, and nothing else reaches the daemon.
#
# A list of things to exclude would have to be extended every time the
# repository grows a directory; this list has to be extended only when the build
# genuinely needs a new input, which is a change somebody notices.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates

# Test targets are not compiled by the release build, and their fixtures are
# files shaped like data. Neither belongs in a builder.
crates/*/tests
crates/*/benches

# Never, under any circumstances, and regardless of the rules above.
**/target
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.csv
**/*.xls
**/*.xlsx
**/*.ofx
**/*.qif
**/*.pdf
